        "id": 121521,
        "name": "Koga",
        "username": "Koga",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-03T23:37:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Baron Blade's text is actually phrased differently, if I remember rightly - it specifies \"When Baron Blade would be destroyed…\", not \"When Baron Blade would be reduced to 0hp or fewer…\". That's why you can't insta-kill him on his front side with stuff like Wrathful Gaze or Suckerpunch (which you could with, say, Apostate).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Same for Skinwalker Gloomweaver, but they can both be lost to an Unforgiving Wasteland on their front side.</p>",
